
# AI Study-Work Balance Assistant

## About the Project
This project helps students balance their studies, internships, projects, and personal activities.

## Features
- Add tasks and deadlines
- Set task priorities
- Categorize tasks
- Track daily productivity
- Plan weekly activities

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Streamlit
- GitHub

## Installation
Install the required library:
pip install -r requirements.txt

## Run the Project
streamlit run app.py

## Goal
To help students manage their time effectively and improve productivity.
